    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "Act 2 — the actual build",
      "narration_text": "Find where the work was actually breaking — bottlenecks, missed handoffs, no clear owner at each stage. Design the workflow — who approves, in what order, and why. Drive adoption — a process nobody follows isn't a process; this is the step most people underestimate. Iterate — real usage always exposes what the design missed, and you fix it without starting over.",
