    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "Act 3 — the point",
      "narration_text": "Anyone can follow an existing SOP. Building one that cross-functional stakeholders — people who don't report to you — will actually adopt, is a different skill entirely. That's the line between operations support and operations design.",
